      "updated": 1782074337017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "question 2 : what if library scales \n1. optimaztion \nOLTP = delta format - parquet format\nCSV format  \nspark \npartition of data and isolation. \n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
