      "index": "b34V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 464903865,
      "version": 382,
      "versionNonce": 1556847191,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782243066749,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Handle sensor failures (stuck sensors, offline sensors) gracefully\n\nHistorical analytics — peak hours, average occupancy by zone, seasonal patterns\nScale & Constraints\nScale: 50,000 sensors × 2 updates/minute = 100K events/minute\nLatency: Availability updated within 5 seconds of sensor change\nReliability: 5% of sensors are offline at any time (stale data handling)\nGeospatial: H3 or geohash indexing for zone-level aggregation\nStorage: 2 years of historical occupancy data for trend analysis\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Handle sensor failures (stuck sensors, offline sensors) gracefully\n\nHistorical analytics — peak hours, average occupancy by zone, seasonal patterns\nScale & Constraints\nScale: 50,000 sensors × 2 updates/minute = 100K events/minute\nLatency: Availability updated within 5 seconds of sensor change\nReliability: 5% of sensors are offline at any time (stale data handling)\nGeospatial: H3 or geohash indexing for zone-level aggregation\nStorage: 2 years of historical occupancy data for trend analysis\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
