      "text": "1. understanding logic \n2 querry and then\noptimize it \n3 test cases to check \n(indexed and table for\noptimization also aliases\nand indentation use\njoins like broadcast\njoin(in pyspark) instead\nof any other join \nodering and window\nfunction)\n\n",
